# Fault W-D-F1: a move whose `at` is a hole, inside a binding, was refused `LOAD-FIELD cash is not a field of pay`.
# L §5.14: "A hole day or `when` makes a hole movement"; E §4.1 step 2. pay's law date d has no value, so its day is the
# hole d: the binding's member is unknown and the sum is the hole d (q). (The fault's text stated `outside PLN`; an
# outside place states no unit now (L §5.10), so it is dropped here.)
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source own "own"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input d: date
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
move pay: transfers
  on d
  at d
  leg cash from konto to world amount 1
ask q: sum(t.cash.amount for t in transfers over 2026-02)
=== expect
q: ?"d: no value" (d)
  cut 2026-10-20
